# Intel call-ins on the Union of Progressive Peoples list (UPP, BEAR).

## UPP kommissar detail
cmu-job-title-upp-kommissar-guard = Kommissar Guard
cmu-upp-kommissar-guard-name = UPP Kommissar Guard
cmu-upp-kommissar-guard-supervisors = the kommissar you are guarding
cmu-upp-kommissar-guard-description = You are a UPP line infantryman assigned to guard a kommissar. Keep them alive, enforce their orders and carry out the sentences they hand down.
cmu-upp-kommissar-guard-rules = You are a member of the UPP. You are ALLIED to the UPP, NEUTRAL to civilians and HOSTILE to the enemies of the Union. Protect your kommissar and follow their orders; any execution must be ordered by them.

